  "title": "How it works",
  "seoTitle": "How it works | Advice4you",
  "description": "How Advice4you works, step by step. What to bring, how we agree the cost and how we keep you in control.",
  "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#04070f\",\"text\":\"#e8ecf2\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-text-color has-background\" style=\"background-color:#04070f;color:#e8ecf2;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\"} -->\n<p class=\"kicker\">How it works</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Simple from the first message.</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>No long forms. No waiting rooms. You tell us the problem and we tell you clearly how we can help.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#f6f3ec\",\"text\":\"#0e1424\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-text-color has-background\" style=\"background-color:#f6f3ec;color:#0e1424;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)\"><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><li><strong>Send a message.</strong> Use WhatsApp, phone or email. Tell us your name, your language and a few words about the problem.</li><li><strong>We talk.</strong> We listen, look at your papers and tell you what we can do. You know the cost before any work starts.</li><li><strong>We do the work together.</strong> Letters, forms, calls and online accounts. We explain every step as we go.</li><li><strong>You stay in control.</strong> Nothing is sent or signed without your OK. You keep copies of everything.</li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What to bring</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>The letters or emails you received</li><li>Your ID and any reference numbers</li><li>Your phone, if you have online accounts</li><li>A short list of your questions</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">About cost</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Contacting us is free. Before we start any paid work, we tell you the price and what it includes. If we cannot help, we say so, and where we can we point you to someone who can.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#0b1530\",\"text\":\"#e8ecf2\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-text-color has-background\" style=\"background-color:#0b1530;color:#e8ecf2;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Bring us the letter. We will read it together.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Send a short message. Tell us your name, your language and a few words about the problem.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/447466951175?text=Hello%20Advice4you%2C%20I%20would%20like%20some%20help.\">Message us on WhatsApp</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/contact/\">Contact</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
}
